<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine 1997 vehicle sales seen rising.</title>
<headline>Philippine 1997 vehicle sales seen rising.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total vehicle sales in the Philippines in 1997 will rise to 189,500 units from 162,095 last year, the Chamber of Automotive Manufacturers of the Philippines Inc (CAMPI) said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that sales of passenger cars should rise to 100,000 units from 88,977 in 1996.</p>
<p>Commercial vehicle sales should rise to 89,500 from 73,118 in 1996, CAMPI said.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8914</p>
</text>
